{"id":"dash-goes-home","title":"Dash Goes Home","level":6,"series":"Dash Adventures","cover":{"h":"3cf7b0755d559800b160ac601ef8fb6c","t":"image/webp"},"titleAudio":null,"cast":[{"role":"hero","name":"Logan","portrait":{"h":"cf541143e9c73f6a4921ebd5175623cb","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"sister","name":"Anastasia","portrait":{"h":"4b8a1a7bc845473e95a93b7d3c7d3a7d","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"dad","name":"Dad","portrait":{"h":"4a3effd5da379d9c095d2ece4f986c49","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"mum","name":"Mum","portrait":{"h":"4e8d5c2035e2129d567a2a2bbf62e944","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"dash","name":"Dash","portrait":{"h":"5394e0f1443cd76f83368aaf141c3340","t":"image/webp"}}],"mystery":null,"practise":["home","take","make","time","shakes","these","smiles","nose","wave"],"common":["says","have","come","two","push","she","so"],"challenge":["machine","dinosaur","dinosaurs","Sundays"],"before":"Where do you think Dash came from? Who might he miss?","after":["Why was Dash sad?","How did they get to the land of dinosaurs?","How did Logan feel when Dash found his mum?","What do you think Dash does on Sundays?"],"retell":[1,3,5,6,10,15],"pages":[{"text":"Dash is sad. He misses his home and his mum.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"3831457f1c4f4b643566ef574969a7e4","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"A rainy afternoon in Logan's bedroom.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Logan has a plan.","bubble":{"who":"hero","name":"Logan","text":"We can take you home!","side":"left"},"image":{"h":"d7d56a24504b53e0611c6eba99947027","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Logan kneels by Dash with a hand on his back and a kind smile.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"They make a time machine in Dad's shed.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"9b01d12531206bfd4b092fca004c09df","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"The garden shed turned into a time machine: an old armchair, a wall of dials, levers and blinking fairy lights, an old clock and tin cans.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Logan presses the big red button.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"d479f2e9dfd6fdd4136e55b9b9b30e84","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Close-up of Logan's finger pressing a big red button with a label.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"The shed shakes. Flash! Bang!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"e76ce48fb82c4df9c134aa32baec9836","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"The shed shakes, with swirling rainbow light pouring out of the window and the gaps in the planks.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"They step out. These trees are so tall, and these dinosaurs are so big!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"fc8834402802217297e2c64161a71436","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"A breathtaking prehistoric valley: giant ferns and tall trees, a smoking volcano far away, long-necked dinosaurs drinking from a lake and flying reptiles in the","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Dash smiles. He is home at last!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"2fc95d5c01964190267c39c18f393f6e","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dash runs ahead through the ferns with his arms out, smiling hugely.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Then they spot a dinosaur next to the lake. She is as big as a bus!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"9a10d84d33772fca9e3b49adffefc09b","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dash's mum stands beside a lake, turning her head towards them.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"It is Dash's mum!","bubble":{"who":"dash","name":"Dash","text":"Mum!","side":"left"},"image":{"h":"7da0d9227b5a1979a0d66921c4902f3c","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dash and his huge mum see each other: joyful recognition.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Dash runs to his mum. She rubs her nose on him.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"74293640372f7301d366bd65c3a5b3d0","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dash's giant mum gently nuzzles tiny Dash with her big nose.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Logan is glad. But he is sad too. He will miss Dash.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"c5a77543e86d0914aacb5b8aef0e037b","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Logan smiles but his chin wobbles.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Dash's mum smiles. She pushes Dash back to Logan.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"4c59b6602cd07b5a2165d1029b372ba8","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dash's mum gently nudges Dash towards Logan with her nose.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"She nods and says...","bubble":{"who":"dashMum","name":"Dash's mum","text":"Go and have fun. Come home on Sundays!","side":"left"},"image":{"h":"e1a70e0620365cba7b245053a3def99c","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dash's mum nods warmly.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"They wave and step back into the shed.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"d7105d82e5ad5c40be5f183afb9431f1","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Logan, Anastasia and Dash wave from the shed door; Dash's mum waves her tail.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"So now Dash has two homes!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"1936cb4447e958657f97411f6f0e9208","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Back home in Logan's bedroom at night: Dash asleep in Dad's floppy hat on the bed.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}}],"words":{}}